From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhangzhaohong-dev <zhangzhaohong.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:37:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Paint block backgrounds before sibling inline content

Port of https://github.com/DioxusLabs/blitz/pull/1767.

Adapted to the patched paint path: the Decoration/Content split keeps the scene-part markers, skips re-homed abspos children and scrollbars in the Decoration pass, and treats outline (Content) and outset shadow (Decoration) inside the clip-path layer where the #1726 port moved them. Re-homed children are detected with paint_parent_override (no lifted_paint_offset here), and only Element/AnonymousBlock nodes are grouped since render_element is called directly.
---
 src/render.rs | 126 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------
 1 file changed, 101 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)

